Maintainer: Gerald KERMA <devel@cybermind.fr>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: secubox-vortex-firewall
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, secubox-core (>= 1.0.0)
Description: SecuBox Vortex Firewall — nftables threat-feed enforcer
 Subscribes to threat feeds (Spamhaus, AbuseIPDB, FireHOL, internal
 SecuBox blocklists) and compiles them into nftables sets for
 inline drop/log enforcement. Complements secubox-vortex-dns (which
 handles DNS-layer blocking via RPZ).
